pkgname=chwd-db
pkgver=1.24.1
pkgrel=2
pkgdesc="Transitional dummy package - the hardware profile database ships inside chwd"
arch=('any')
url="https://github.com/cachyos/chwd"
license=('GPL-3.0-or-later')
depends=('chwd')
options=(!strip !emptydirs)

package() {
    install -d "${pkgdir}/usr/share/doc/${pkgname}"
    cat > "${pkgdir}/usr/share/doc/${pkgname}/README" <<'DOC'
chwd-db is a transitional dummy package and installs no functional files.

The hardware profile database it used to carry now ships inside chwd itself,
under /var/lib/chwd/db/{pci,usb}. chwd declares provides/replaces/conflicts on
chwd-db, so any reference to this name is already satisfied by chwd alone.

This package exists only so that configurations still naming chwd-db keep
resolving. It can be dropped once nothing references it.
DOC
}
